    "That was a real dictation. Try one more in your own words, or continue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eso fue un dictado real. Prueba otro con tus propias palabras o continúa."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今のは実際の音声入力です。自分の言葉でもう一度試すか、次へ進んでください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刚才是一次真实的听写。用你自己的话再试一次，或者继续下一步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剛才是真的聽寫。用你自己的話再試一次，或繼續下一步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s it. Hold to talk, let go to insert." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eso es todo. Mantén pulsado para hablar y suelta para insertar."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これで完了です。長押しで話し、離すと入力されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "就是这样。按住说话，松开即插入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "就是這樣。按住說話，放開即插入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s it. Press to start, press again to insert." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eso es todo. Pulsa para empezar y vuelve a pulsar para insertar."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これで完了です。押して開始し、もう一度押すと入力されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "就是这样。按一下开始，再按一次即插入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "就是這樣。按一下開始，再按一次即插入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu and recording window keep their size" : {
